c cells in ageing</article-title><source>J Clin Immunol</source><year>2008</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>14</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17828583</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10875-007-9127-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Effros</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Role of T lymphocyte replicative senescence in vaccine efficacy</article-title><source>Vaccine</source><year>2007</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>599</fpage><lpage>604</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17014937</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.vaccine.2006.08.032</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>